Assignment 1.04 - Player and Trainers

Hello TA,

This version of the pokegame implements the player character and the npcs for real! (almost). For movement of the player character, I have chosen a stoic protagonist who stands there ground at any challenge (i.e. he does not move). That being said he will never spawn on the border or a gate either. The code follows all requirements of characters based on the report doc, as well as their movements. I've split the the types of characters in two, by who they are and how they move. i.e. this allows me to make pacers that are swimmers, etc. depending on where units spawn.

Character and player movement order is determined by a priority queue, and ties are broken by a sequence number assigned to the pc/npc on creation.

There exists a switch --numtrainers x that takes an int that allows you to spawn more trainers when running the build, with a default of 10. There will also always be at least 1 hiker and 1 rival.

If there are any questions feel free to reach me at griffinu@iastate.edu


